.TH VIBEOS-TERMINAL 1 "2026-11-24" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-terminal \- terminal for VibeOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-terminal
.SH DESCRIPTION
A terminal for a touchscreen, on GNOME's terminal widget (VTE), running the user's shell. A tap brings the keyboard, a long press selects text and offers Copy, Paste and Select all, and a drag of one finger or two scrolls: the history, or in a program on the alternate screen (less, man) the cursor keys, or for a program that tracks the mouse (htop, mc) the mouse wheel. Ctrl+Shift+C copies and Ctrl+Shift+V pastes. It is D-Bus activatable as vibeos.Terminal.
.SH SEE ALSO
vibeos-launcher(1)
